<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle prices steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady on light test, compared to Monday's close, USDA said. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 600.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 81.00-84.00. Medium and Large 2 400-500 lbs 82.00-85.00. Holsteins - Large 2 10 head 440 lbs 72.30.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 67.00-71.25. Medium and Large 2 500-600 lbs 65.00-74.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
